Cell["\<\
Vertical edges do not count: the prism has a rung in every fiber and still \
has at most one lift.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"fbb4e3c0-f5d2-459e-867b-092975366167"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
